# The site needs no credentials, and neither does reading Notion.
#
# Content is fetched from Notion's public API by scripts/fetch-notion.mjs and
# committed to the repo; the build and the served site never talk to Notion.
#
# Uploading videos to the DigitalOcean Space happens in CI only, using the
# repository secrets DO_SPACES_KEY and DO_SPACES_SECRET. To run the upload by
# hand (scripts/sync-media.sh), export those two in your shell.
#
# NOTION_API_SECRET is only used by scripts/notion_export.py, which is kept as
# reference material and is not part of the build.
